{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a183fe4a354330c3","type":"text","text":"GUI：图形用户界面——就是给普通用户用的","x":-392,"y":-236,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d642e25d8144a6c","type":"text","text":"GUI库：调用库的相关函数就可以快速绘制出所需的用户界面","x":-3,"y":-249,"width":250,"height":89},
		{"id":"d4de556e22f9fa01","type":"text","text":"常见的GUI库：emWin，LVGL，TouchGFX，QT","x":340,"y":-250,"width":250,"height":88},
		{"id":"7dc363d85011e5b6","type":"text","text":"QT市场占有率很高的","x":720,"y":-296,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e62327fb57b3794d","type":"text","text":"LVGL：Light and Versatile Graphics Library","x":-8,"y":-14,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9f9bdb4050be6008","type":"text","text":"组件分类","x":359,"y":-19,"width":141,"height":60},
		{"id":"f6f163797c3c09e1","type":"text","text":"静态组件\n交互组件\n特殊组件","x":600,"y":-37,"width":120,"height":107},
		{"id":"fc103dce446a8764","type":"text","text":"简单需求","x":309,"y":232,"width":121,"height":60},
		{"id":"f53c2ef35bc40ff0","type":"text","text":"数码管：展示英文字母和数字\n分辨率的概念，128X64 OLED显示屏来了\n彩色屏幕，LCD，RGB显示模式，展示图片\n==不过上面的简单需求都是设置单独像素点的颜色，从而展示出完整的画面==","x":560,"y":182,"width":455,"height":160},
		{"id":"8690280ba2d926c4","type":"text","text":"LVGL 基础课程","x":-392,"y":292,"width":162,"height":60},
		{"id":"dffdddb2e2ed4d99","type":"text","text":"高级需求","x":302,"y":510,"width":128,"height":60},
		{"id":"3bb354c2629cfa28","type":"text","text":"顶级需求","x":283,"y":751,"width":117,"height":50},
		{"id":"3fb3f32896be3ad0","type":"text","text":"windows linux 安卓 IOS操作系统 自带有更高级的UI\n前端UI","x":481,"y":731,"width":479,"height":60},
		{"id":"2a4f3d2a86374c2c","type":"text","text":"使用图形库，从而能够实现一个动画效果，调库，\n在屏幕的不同区域实现效果\n","x":540,"y":510,"width":448,"height":60},
		{"id":"3c735c70ad55f001","type":"text","text":"LVGL：扣！！！！对于内存和FLASH的要求不高","x":588,"y":432,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"64afe3b5e8c3af01","type":"text","text":"SDL:就是用来渲染内容的东西","x":-660,"y":620,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8b5fa0eefaf2724f","type":"text","text":"UI界面的需求","x":-120,"y":570,"width":144,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"8ff96d270c8d3e58","type":"text","text":"vscode开发环境IDE","x":-922,"y":188,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8e4696cbf9475730","type":"text","text":"windows的c语言编译器gcc","x":-922,"y":370,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8b262ddc2c89d71f","type":"text","text":"cmake工具=》keil中的管理项目中的.c文件和.h文件","x":-915,"y":282,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9520527ccff3653b","type":"text","text":"当前运行的案例项目，再整一个lvgl9.5版本","x":-910,"y":468,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"966718c7b3585971","type":"text","text":"构建开发环境","x":-1200,"y":340,"width":142,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e3b6b43922e7fb3d","type":"text","text":"LVGL基础开发逻辑","x":-166,"y":1132,"width":186,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5011d33df1b454cb","type":"text","text":"（1）初始化时钟外设等","x":122,"y":1084,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f0cadc60b5a8cbc9","type":"text","text":"1.windows 已经执行完毕\nSTM32=》启动文件 初始化文件","x":447,"y":1069,"width":274,"height":91},
		{"id":"555c37cb47f3c3a5","type":"text","text":"（2）调用lv_init()\n","x":122,"y":1212,"width":187,"height":60},
		{"id":"7528c7eede9467e7","type":"text","text":"初始化LVGL的配置\n大量使用#if判断宏定义 启动对应的功能初始\n所有的功能配置都在文件lv_conf.h中","x":446,"y":1193,"width":374,"height":98},
		{"id":"0510286255d303b8","type":"text","text":"刷新率=1s除以刷新的率","x":459,"y":1340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a81144cf79246028","type":"text","text":"周期调用lv_timer_handle（）函数","x":471,"y":1520,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cad48bac2f75c09d","type":"text","text":"直接影响帧率=》1s调用函数60次稳定运行=》屏幕60帧\n90:#define LV_DEF_REFR_PERIOD 33\n公式：lv_timer_handle()+睡眠时间（延时时间）=#define LV_DEF_REFR_PERIOD\n刷新显示=》影响帧数的底层原因\n读取输入的设备=》包括触摸屏\n出发调回时间\n运行动画\n","x":834,"y":1475,"width":526,"height":405},
		{"id":"05a851087185eb9a","type":"text","text":"1.获取当前页面的整个屏幕：lv_obj * scr=lv_screen_active();\n2.创建一个新的框：lv_obj_t *obj=lv_obj_create(scr); (默认的大小100X100的圆角框)","x":315,"y":2040,"width":699,"height":60},
		{"id":"97f317373efed8ea","type":"text","text":"自定义页面","x":100,"y":2100,"width":144,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"50a05c115d010099","type":"text","text":"不同的控件都是相同的结构体","x":315,"y":2170,"width":725,"height":60},
		{"id":"7b35fefb267a3cd3","x":-574,"y":2252,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"lv_obj_get_parent（widget）,一般是不推荐使用给模块命名的方式，这样想当的占用空间，所以一般都是去给下标命名的方式"},
		{"id":"bf2cfe60bcdfcc66","x":147,"y":2461,"width":87,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"父级子级"},
		{"id":"66cee16b365170ff","x":315,"y":2521,"width":163,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"子级在上，父级在下"},
		{"id":"35ede41620e52c29","x":311,"y":2400,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"一个父级可以有子级"},
		{"id":"9eb4c38de4e4785c","x":274,"y":2660,"width":286,"height":85,"type":"text","text":" 一般采用的是去找下角标，而不是去命名，命名的话很占用内存"}
	],
